  "body": "## Problem\n\nThe site test `test_component_static_icons_and_license_match_app` (`site/tests/test_guide_icons.py`) fails on `main`:\n\n```\nAssertionError: False is not true : Missing site icon .../site/static/icons/act-report.png\nAssertionError: Items in the second set but not the first:\n'act-report' : Stale or missing PNGs in site/static/icons/\n```\n\nCommit 984b2af6c (`feat(ui): report door with prefilled GitHub issue and clipboard screenshot`) added `assets/ui/act-report.png` and its row in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/icons.rs`. It did not add the copy in `site/static/icons/`. The test requires that each icon of the table has a byte-identical copy there.\n\nThe site tests are not in a gate on `main` now. #2643 adds them to the site job of `release.yml`. When #2643 merges, this failure makes the site job red.\n\n## Steps to reproduce\n\n1. On `main` (checked at 0957b20aa), run `python3 -m unittest discover -s site/tests`.\n2. The test gives the two failures above. The other tests that do not need Zola pass.\n\n## Fix\n\nCopy `assets/ui/act-report.png` to `site/static/icons/act-report.png`.\n\nSuggested labels: `P5`, `effort:low`, `area:ui`.\n",
